, 0);\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/kanemura.miku/2018-11-14/26736_2.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_6864.jpeg\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">2期生は初めてのKEYABINGO!だったので、</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">ドッチボールをしたり…男装したり…</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">コスプレをしたり…新たな体験ばかりでとても刺激を受けました💥</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">ぜひチェックしてくださいね！</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">─────────────────</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 9px 0px 8px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/kanemura.miku/2018-11-14/26736_3.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_6787.jpeg\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">久々に渋谷のスクランブル交差点に来たので</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">謎に撮った写真を加工しました🥀</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">それでは！</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">see you later ✩*.ﾟ#82</span></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px;\"><br></p></div>\n                    ",
